X La autodeterminación digital reclama que personas y comunidades puedan decidir cómo se recopilan sus datos, qué tecnologías median sus relaciones y bajo qué reglas.
E Digital self-determination demands that people and communities be able to decide how their data is collected, which technologies mediate their relationships, and under what rules.
C ['La autodeterminación digital']
N Old_back is lexically accurate. The source is bare and Spanish usage remains somewhat fluid; self-review adopts the broad individual-and-collective agency sense and flags its boundary with informational self-determination.
