N Materially reorders old_back: désintoxication numérique is understandable, but détox numérique is the more idiomatic France-French production label. Self-review replaced a translated attention perdue metaphor with the natural manque à gagner.
it_big_tech_vocab_020 the Attention economy => l’économie de l’attention | alts: []
R Established media-economics and technology-criticism term for markets that capture, measure and monetize a scarce cognitive resource.
