N Materially improves old_back by promoting the more idiomatic capitalisme rentier numérique; the direct rentiérisme calque remains intelligible but is less established. Self-review preserved that register difference.
it_big_tech_vocab_071 Global tech governance => la gouvernance mondiale des technologies | alts: []
R Formal international-relations term for institutions, standards and multistakeholder processes governing technologies with cross-border reach.
T Gouvernance is broader than gouvernement or réglementation: it includes coordination, standards, firms and civil society as well as binding state rules.
X La gouvernance mondiale des technologies associe États, entreprises et société civile pour fixer des normes transfrontalières que la seule réglementation nationale ne peut imposer.
