it_big_tech_vocab_079 the Algorithmic means of control => les dispositifs algorithmiques de contrôle | alts: ['les moyens de contrôle algorithmiques']
R Critical labor and surveillance expression; dispositifs is idiomatic analytical French when concrete systems and procedures are at issue.
