it_big_tech_vocab_082 Algorithmic regulation => la régulation algorithmique | alts: ['la régulation par les algorithmes']
R Specialist public-policy and sociology term for governing conduct through automated scoring, ranking or rule enforcement; the alternative makes the instrument explicit.
T Régulation algorithmique means regulation performed through algorithms; regulation of algorithms is la régulation des algorithmes, with des rather than par.
