it_big_tech_vocab_088 the Corporate walled gardens => les jardins clos des plateformes | alts: ['les écosystèmes fermés des plateformes']
R Established competition-policy and advertising metaphor for company-controlled platform environments; the alternative is explanatory and less figurative.
